{"title":"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73d4942223b9a4abf4a60cea9d75515b9fcdd4ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(u_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\">sequence</a> of real numbers satifying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb76eb44837d063420712e9ea5219a9b8670427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{n+2}=2u_{n+1}+u_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" />,\n</p><p>and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5f1991a77ad081060e266e45f3d82437bc12f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_3=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20ed2ec6d0cccd306e68a2701136b75739461e79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_6=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797d6fa25145b7d95e277d3912b85d14c7c8cb3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c6839e0cbed0f8d21b3202ec2cd567fffc6152.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 40\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 53\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 68\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 88\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 104$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, we get \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c6e57b4980da77a3d343cef4e6c1825601f6df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128=2u_5+u_4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" /></center> \n<p>By plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we get \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a413dedc5b1485079f3771cbdd231293ae79c5a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_5=2u_4+9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" /></center>\n<p>This is a system of two equations with two unknowns. Multiplying the second equation by 2 and substituting into the first equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd6e694a84fa2fb5dee020f5aaa05e55c603fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128=5u_4+18 \\Longrightarrow u_4=22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"218\" height=\"15\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e12e9e8ab7e7101fae33b8de57e82351318975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_5=\\frac{128-22}{2}=53 \\longrightarrow \\textbf{\\boxed{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"238\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose the first 2 terms are x and y, then we can list the rest of the terms by the given definition.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/735bd41de67f5d9de6d39df62f27d9a85ed19a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x , y, 2y+x, 5y+2x, 12y+5x, 29y+12x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Then from this we get the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/6/7a62b72148308981824324fdc8f62be625a7068d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29y+12x=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/0/c40e25bbf4f9942940893a7744b6f1b31041f886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y+x=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Solving these we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Then we find the 5th term by substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dbdede50efa1ce8105ca4742452eb38568427b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12y+5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" /> and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a558b37c441e1b7ac7c5ff6a848f199ac53ba75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~biegetomcat72\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B\">2008 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:cen